            "review_title": "Review at Cong Chieng Tay Nguyen - Da Lat",
            "review_text": "NahI'dWin\nVietnam2 contributions\n1\nFirst Time Experiencing Central Highlands Gongs in Da Lat , Truly Unforgettable!\nJul 2026 • Friends\nAn unforgettable evening of Central Highlands culture! Sitting around a roaring bonfire, listening to live gong music, dancing with friendly locals, and tasting authentic rượu cần (tube wine) with grilled pork was amazing. Highly interactive, authentic, and fun.\nInsider tip:\nBring a jacket as it gets chilly at night around the mountain, and wear comfortable shoes so you can easily join in the traditional dancing\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 23, 2026\nGrandTour60174843827\nHello there,\nThank you for the wonderful 5-star feedback!\nHearing you recount your experience of sitting around the campfire, dancing with the local community, and enjoying the Central Highlands cuisine makes us feel incredibly happy and proud too. Thank you for loving the atmosphere, the food, and the service here.\nWe wish you always have joyful trips, and hope to see you again soon in Da Lat!\nRead more\nWritten July 29, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
